SKILL port-to-new-chip  v1
Move the firmware to a different microcontroller.

1. New board.cfg with the new CHIP_ID, PROBE, FLASH_APP and FLASH_PROTECTED regions.
2. New limits.cfg if the hardware ratings changed; the hardware owner signs it:
   kindgleam sign-limits
3. Keep the SIL vectors unchanged: they are the contract the new chip must meet.
4. kindgleam verify (SIL first), then kindgleam verify --tier=pil on the new board.
5. G10 must show SIL and PIL identical; any difference points at the port, not the tests.
